# Baseline security headers for the Netlify deployment.
# Kept conservative on purpose: no Content-Security-Policy here, because the app
# loads KaTeX fonts, Supabase and inline styles and a wrong policy would break
# rendering. CSP should be added separately once its sources are audited.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
